      "title": "Collection",
      "items": [
        "Agent receives OTLP metrics and logs on loopback",
        "Optional fleetglass-statusline forwards Claude plan limits to the same port",
        "Batches are buffered to disk before POST when buffer_dir is set"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Privilege split",
      "items": [
        "Only the helper runs as root",
        "It answers fixed GET paths (SMART, RAPL, Docker, agents, backups)",
        "Socket is group-readable, mode 0660"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Serving",
      "items": [
        "Ingest needs a per-host bearer token",
        "Each accepted batch pushes a fresh overview to SSE subscribers",
        "Hourly maintenance and optional daily backups"
      ]
